  <h2 id="next-step">What to do next</h2>

  <p>
    Start by naming, honestly, where a specific opportunity in front of you actually sits on the spectrum: fast
    income with a hard ceiling, or slower-building income with real growth room. If it is the second kind, the
    next real step is building one piece of visible proof of the skill involved, not waiting until you feel fully
    ready.
  </p>

